    all tabs ina row all flags in a row 
    features  2 above 2 down, just one last change add background color to flag section only, not full width background color should be till subtitle and border radius 6, no flags background should not be full width and border radius to 10, add flags background width option so i can edit accordingly, tabs section are full width add option for that as well flags are not center on desktop subtitle is not below flags section 
    
    add options for all which i can change myself, subtitle below flags on desktop as well still pending, subtitle should be below flags plz, subtitle of tabs should be below flag section on both mobile and desktop

{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

